  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $302.24B (+1.4% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/376048/banking-regulator-occ-genius-act-stablecoin-rules-november\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Banking Regulator Races to Finalize GENIUS Act Stablecoin Rules</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/rain-acquires-ansa-stored-value-merchant-wallets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin Card Issuer Rain Buys Merchant Wallet Startup Ansa</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-08-21-anchorage-ceo-ai-the-jetsons-412427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anchorage CEO says AI agents need bank accounts for \u2018The Jetsons\u2019-like future</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
